ak for anyone who brings a {item:3719} ({skill:165}) and a {item:2997} ({skill:197}); no vendor sells either, so this step shows only when you carry both."] = "Bartolo makes a yeti fur cloak for anyone who brings a Hillman's Cloak (Leatherworking) and a Bolt of Woolen Cloth (Tailoring); no vendor sells either, so this step shows only when you carry both.", ["{npc:4961} waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in {object:2100}; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten."] = "Dashel waits in the Pig and Whistle tavern in Old Town; he and his two thugs fight you, but stop once beaten.", ["{quest:98291} is a group quest: 16 elite Dragonmaw (29-30) in {area:17716}, just east of {npc:270637}. Skip it if you are alone."] = "Death to the Dragonmaw is a group quest: 16 elite Dragonmaw (29-30) in Dragonmaw Retreat, just east of Howin. Skip it if you are alone." },
