455"] = "Ironforge" },
			written = { ["Follow the road west across the north of {zone:1443} to the ruins of {area:2405}. {npc:11863}'s tower stands on the hill there, on the way to the wreck."] = "Follow the road west across the north of Desolace to the ruins of Ethel Rethor. Azore's tower stands on the hill there, on the way to the wreck.", ["The Slitherblade naga hold the north-west coast north of {npc:11863}'s tower, on the shore and out in the water. Karnitol's satchel drops now and then from their Tidehunters and Sea Witches, most of them underwater ({spell:131} helps): take it if it comes, it is optional. Any naga can drop Rackmore's golden key. Swim out to {area:2406} off the far northern tip and use the {item:15766} on the {object:177673}: {npc:12369} (38) rises; kill him for the {quest:6027}."] = "The Slitherblade naga hold the north-west coast north of Azore's tower, on the shore and out in the water. Karnitol's satchel drops now and then from their Tidehunters and Sea Witches, most of them underwater (Water Breathing helps): take it if it comes, it is optional. Any naga can drop Rackmore's golden key. Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip and use the Gem of the Serpent on the Serpent Statue: Lord Kragaru (38) rises; kill him for the Book of the Ancients.", ["The wrecked ship's chest lies just south-west of {npc:11863}'s tower."] = "The wrecked ship's chest lies just south-west of Azore's tower.", ["escort {npc:12277} back toward the graveyard"] = "escort Melizza back toward the graveyard", ["{npc:11863}'s tower stands on the hill at the ruins of {area:2405}, west across the north of {zone:1443}."] = "Azore's tower stands on the hill at the ruins of Ethel Rethor, west across the north of Desolace.", ["{npc:12277} is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.\nCareful: six centaurs attack during the escort, and you can't clear them beforehand: they appear only during the escort and come linked. In players' recordings 14 of 30 people who took it failed at least once. Bring a friend, or skip it if you are alone. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help."] = "Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.\nCareful: six centaurs attack during the escort, and you can't clear them beforehand: they appear only during the escort and come linked. In players' recordings 14 of 30 people who took it failed at least once. Bring a friend, or skip it if you are alone. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.", ["{npc:5638}, if the first {zone:1443} visit didn't take it: the wreck lies below {npc:11863}'s tower"] = "Kreldig Ungor, if the first Desolace visit didn't take it: the wreck lies below Azore's tower", ["{npc:6019} stands at the edge of the {area:596}, south-west of {area:2407}; {object:176751} lie among the skeletons.\nCareful: Rexxar (62, elite), the Horde's champion, walks the road past the graveyard with his bear Misha and attacks Alliance players: when he comes by, step well away from the road and let him pass."] = "Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons.\nCareful: Rexxar (62, elite), the Horde's champion, walks the road past the graveyard with his bear Misha and attacks Alliance players: when he comes by, step well away from the road and let him pass." },
