					note = "The cultists fill the streets and fields of {area:16723}. Start at the ritual circles in the middle (fill Claire's catalyst there), then work west through the burnt houses to the edge of town. The charms, pages and finger bones drop from the cultists; keep the {item:266148} the Twilight Raiders drop: five, one for each grave west of Elbrim's farm.\nKeep the {item:4338} they drop: {npc:263613} in {area:16724} asks for twenty when you are back there. Now and then a cultist drops the {quest:94885}: right-click it to start the quest.\nCareful: {npc:256899}, an elite ogre (level 41), walks the western streets of {area:16723}, around 44-47,47-52. Pull the cultists out towards you and let him pass; players died here more than anywhere else in the zone.\n{npc:263380}, the river's elite (level 42), can wander up from the south-western fields: let him pass.",
