ip it."] = "Marvon's next task, Into the Depths, is inside the Sunken Temple: skip it.", ["{npc:7771}'s {item:10556} stands in {area:392}: fly there first, then on to {area:976}."] = "Marvon's Stone Circle stands in Ratchet: fly there first, then on to Gadgetzan." },
