					title = "{area:537} and the eastern jungle",
					note = "Ride east into the eastern jungle: Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers (48-50) drop the petals and {quest:3764}. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many around the foot of {area:537}: take a few extra of each colour.\nCareful: the Living Blazes (54-55) walk the top of {area:537}, and the Bloodpetal Flayers and Trappers (51-53) hold the jungle's south: take your crystals from the ridge's foot and your petals in the north.\n{npc:9998}'s scales: the {npc:9165} (48-50) glide over the north-east of the jungle and the Young Diemetradons (49-50) graze beside them. There are only ten of those: the Diemetradons (51) on the jungle's western edge, a short way west of the Threshers, drop the scales too. They are a level over you: take them one at a time.",
