				{
					title = "{zone:1419}: kill these as you meet them",
					note = "Ride back south into the {zone:1419} for the bloodmages' beasts: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills south of the bloodmages' camp, Scorpok Stingers scuttle across the middle of the north and {npc:5982} vultures circle over all of it. Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep.\nCareful: two elites roam here: {npc:221740} (50) in the middle of the zone around 44,34, and {npc:247015} (55) on the ridge around 39,32. When you see one, hunt somewhere else.\nCareful: {npc:8301} (53, a rare scorpid) walks the north around 47,36, {npc:8298} (54, rare) the middle around 45,48, and Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground east of here, between Kum'isha's hill and the {area:1440} (about 54-62, 31-47): give them room.\nAny mob here may drop a {item:8244}: keep it for Kum'isha.",
