he Hunter's Path\", [6075] = \"The Hunter's Path\", [6076] = \"The Hunter's Path\" }, map = 1426, x = 45.77, y = 53.01, z = 407.8, note = \"{npc:1231}: the first {item:15908}\" },\n\t\t},\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\ttitle = \"{npc:1126}\",\n\t\tnote = \"Large Crag Boars (level 6-7) root around the fields west, south and north-west of {area:131} and respawn every 3 minutes. How the rod works: target a living beast, use the {item:15908} and stand still for the whole channel while it hits you. Moving, fighting back, being out of range or anyone else's help breaks it and costs one of the rod's few charges; if they run out, destroy the rod, abandon the quest and take it again from {npc:1231}. The boars use {spell:6268} from 25 yards, so start with the rod, not {spell:75}. Keep each rod: it goes back to {npc:1231}.\",\n\t\tonly = { races = { \"Dwarf\" } },\n\t\twhen = { { k = \"onquest\", neg = true, q = { 94792, 94863, 94864, 94793 } }, { k = \"turnedin\", neg = true, q = 94792 } },\n\t\tgoals = {\n\t\t\t{ t = \"kill\", quest = 6064, title = \"Taming the Beast\", target = \"Large Crag Boar\", npc = 1126, count = 1, oi = 1, text = \"{spell:19674}\", map = 1426, x = 49.25, y = 54.76, z = 402.4, f = \"e\", spotsPacked = \"49.1,57.3,,114,5;48.3,63.3,,72,2;58.4,54,,90,3;55.9,47.8,394.1,72,1;50.4,43.2,388.4,72,1;45.2,42.9,,80,3;42.6,38.8,,72,2;42.6,30.1,,72,2;39.4,47.5,,91,5;36.4,53.1,,132,7;63.3,54.5,,72,2;66.2,50.3,,72,2;50.5,52.1,407.1,72,1,1;48.3,47.2,398.2,72,2,1;43.5,34.3,399.4,72,1,1\", spread = true, lvl = 7, note = \"Use the {item:15908} on a living boar\" },\n\t\t\t{ t = \"turnin\", quest = 6064, title = \"Taming the Beast\", npc = 1231, npcName = \"Grif Wildheart\", map = 1426, x = 45.77, y = 53.01, z = 407.8 },\n\t\t\t{ t = \"accept\", quest = 6084, title = \"Taming the Beast\", npc = 1231, npcName = \"Grif Wildheart\", minLevel = 10, qlvl = 10, pre = { 6064 }, preTitles = { [6064] = \"Taming the Beast\" }, map = 1426, x = 45.77, y = 53.01, z = 407.8 },\n\t\t},\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\