040}, a second repeatable turn-in; then the optional hubs, best rate first: {area:188} (about 35 a minute at full value), {area:186} (28), {area:442} (23). Every {faction:69} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.\",\n\t\tgoals = {\n\t\t\t{ t = \"level\", level = 12 },\n\t\t\t{ t = \"collect\", item = 2592, itemName = \"Wool Cloth\", count = 60, note = \"{item:2592}: furbolgs, satyrs and naga in {zone:1439} and {zone:1440}\", candidates = { { npc = 568, npcName = \"Shadowhide Warrior\", map = 1433, x = 71.7, y = 38.4, faction = \"A\", lvl = { min = 24, max = 25 }, rate = 0.235, spawns = 11 }, { npc = 1727, npcName = \"Defias Worker\", map = 1436, x = 39.6, y = 77.9, f = \"e\", faction = \"A\", lvl = { min = 16, max = 17 }, rate = 0.189, spawns = 12 }, { npc = 437, npcName = \"Blackrock Renegade\", map = 1433, x = 72.3, y = 69.2, faction = \"A\", lvl = { min = 21, max = 22 }, rate = 0.241, spawns = 9 }, { npc = 429, npcName = \"Shadowhide Darkweaver\", map = 1433, x = 74.5, y = 47.7, faction = \"A\", lvl = { min = 25, max = 26 }, rate = 0.239, spawns = 9 }, { npc = 435, npcName = \"Blackrock Champion\", map = 1428, x = 69.3, y = 84.5, f = \"e\", faction = \"AH\", lvl = { min = 24, max = 25 }, rate = 0.239, spawns = 7 }, { npc = 615, npcName = \"Blackrock Tracker\", map = 1428, x = 70.4, y = 85.4, f = \"e\", faction = \"AH\", lvl = { min = 23, max = 24 }, rate = 0.242, spawns = 6 }, { npc = 1167, npcName = \"Stonesplinter Digger\", map = 1432, x = 70.6, y = 66.9, f = \"e\", faction = \"A\", lvl = { min = 18, max = 19 }, rate = 0.195, spawns = 7 }, { npc = 2557, npcName = \"Witherbark Shadow Hunter\", map = 1417, x = 67.3, y = 80.8, f = \"e\", faction = \"AH\", lvl = { min = 35, max = 36 }, rate = 0.039, spawns = 11 }, { npc = 2566, npcName = \"Boulderfist Brute\", map = 1417, x = 53, y = 74.2, f = \"e\", faction = \"AH\", lvl = {